---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | ApprovedDecorators">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-blue">
    <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p>By using ApprovedDecorators services, you agree to the following terms.</p>
    <h2>12-Month Guarantee</h2>
    <p>All completed painting and decorating work is covered by our comprehensive 12-month guarantee against peeling, blistering, and significant fading due to workmanship errors.</p>
    <h2>Pricing and Quotes</h2>
    <p>Quotes provided online are estimates. Final pricing may be adjusted based on an on-site survey and specific material requirements. All final prices will be agreed upon before work commences.</p>
    <h2>Public Liability</h2>
    <p>All our decorators operate with a minimum of £2M Public Liability Insurance, ensuring complete peace of mind while work is being carried out on your property.</p>
    <h2>Cancellations</h2>
    <p>We require at least 48 hours notice for any cancellations or rescheduling of scheduled work.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
